<title>UK: British Steel off amid talk of BZW downgrade.</title>
<headline>British Steel off amid talk of BZW downgrade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in British Steel Plc fell on Thursday amid talk that analysts at BZW had downgraded their recommendation on the stock to &quot;sell&quot; from &quot;hold&quot;, market sources said.</p>
<p>The shares were 1-3/4p lower at 156-1/4 by 1227 GMT.</p>
<p>Analysts at BZW declined to comment.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
</text>
